---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/page/PageHero.astro';
const themes = [{id: 'light', label: '浅色 · Paper'}, {id: 'dark', label: '深色 · Night'}];
---
<BaseLayout title="Reading annotations — Component library">
  <PageHero title="Reading annotations" crumbs={['Component library']} meta={{}} />
  <main class="annotation-preview" id="annotation-pilot">
    <header><p class="eyebrow">正文语义标注 · 全站公共样式</p><h2>让精确内容更容易辨认</h2><p>下列为排版示例，不是实验结果或操作方案。两个面板展示相同内容，可直接对照阅读。</p></header>
    <div class="annotation-grid">
      {themes.map(theme => <article class="prose annotation-scope" data-annotation-theme={theme.id} aria-label={theme.label}>
        <p class="eyebrow">{theme.label}</p>
        <h3>从术语到准确引用</h3>
        <p><strong>核糖体结合位点（RBS）</strong>首次出现时解释含义，后文直接使用 RBS。物种名 <em>Escherichia coli</em> 保持斜体。</p>
        <p>示例短序列为 <code>5′-ATGCGT-3′</code>。参数表达式 <code>pH=7.0</code> 使用行内框；普通条件 37 °C、24 h 保持正文。</p>
        <p><strong>框内内容用于准确引用。</strong>查看 <code>CHECKPOINT-03.md</code>，或运行 <code>npm run verify</code>。中文文件名 <code>素材登记表.csv</code> 使用同一规则。</p>
        <p>长路径也能在窄屏换行：<code>website/src/components/page/annotation-examples/reading-experience-preview.astro</code>。</p>
        <aside class="callout callout--note" aria-label="设计依据"><span class="callout__icon" aria-hidden="true">i</span><div><p class="callout__title">设计依据</p><div class="callout__body"><p>术语、结论和精确文本各用一种表达方式。提示框承载完整解释，不把整段正文变成标签。</p></div></div></aside>
        <h3>多行命令独立呈现</h3>
        <pre><code>npm run verify
npm run test:captions</code></pre>
      </article>)}
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.annotation-preview { max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 24px 96px; }
.annotation-preview header { max-width: 760px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
.annotation-preview h2 { font-size: clamp(25px, 3vw, 36px); margin: 8px 0 12px; }
.eyebrow { font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .04em; font-weight: 650; }
.annotation-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 24px; }
.annotation-scope { min-width: 0; padding: 28px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--paper); }
.annotation-scope > * + * { margin-top: 20px; }
.annotation-scope[data-annotation-theme='light'] { --paper: #fbf8f1; --paper-hi: #fffdf8; --ink: #302936; --ink-2: #514958; --iris: #6e4fb8; --line: #ddd5e4; --loam: #302536; --cream: #fbf8f1; }
@media screen {
.annotation-scope[data-annotation-theme='dark'] { color-scheme: dark; --paper: #16121c; --paper-hi: #1e1926; --ink: #e9e2ef; --ink-2: #c4bbcf; --iris: #9378e6; --line: #463b52; --loam: #241e2d; --cream: #eee8f4; }
}
@media (max-width: 800px) { .annotation-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .annotation-preview { padding-inline: 16px; } .annotation-scope { padding: 22px 18px; } }
</style>
